- `msg[0..4]` = 堆指针: 0x555555559480, 0x5555555594e0, 0x555555559520, 0x555555559540, 0x555555559580
- `msg[5..31]` = 全为零
- `msg_size[0..4]` = 0x50, 0x30, 0x18, 0x38, 0x40
